DSwritesync modifications (since the vendored baseline):
- Root package.json build scripts adapted from yarn to pnpm and a
  packageManager field added.
- DSwritesync branding: manifest/UI/binary names, project icon, and removal
  of upstream telemetry, remote config, version checks and promotional
  banners.
- Browser side panel shell with Capture / Sync / Accounts / History tabs;
  the capture UI is an independent implementation inspired by StashDock's
  interaction and visuals (no StashDock code copied).
- Desk protocol over Chrome Native Messaging: the extension pairs with the
  local MIT helper (`native/` in the main repository) for capture, task
  delivery and receipts. The earlier CLI/WS/token bridge was retired and
  removed (ADR 0012).
- Chinese/English UI localization.
- Removed the in-extension editor; kept platform adapters, CMS, sync dialog,
  page-level FAB and the WeChat sync overlays.

